{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46821","headline":"寄酬秦府高推官辇 · 齐己","name":"寄酬秦府高推官辇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天台衡岳旧曾寻，闲忆留题白石林。\n岁月已残衰飒鬓，风骚犹壮寂寥心。\n缑山碧树遮藏密，丹穴红霞掩暎深。\n争得相逢一携手，拂衣同去听玄音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46821.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46821","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}